        <Param val="Welcome to the experiment!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;In this experiment you will be shown short streams of capital letters flashing quickly, one after another, in the centre of the screen. Your task is to detect specific letters in the streams. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Your participation is voluntary and you may withdraw at anytime without any reason. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Press SPACE to read further&amp;#10;" valType="str" updates="constant" name="text"/>
