        <Param val="Task 1: Detect the letter X&amp;#10;&amp;#10;In this task, you will see a rapid stream of black capital letters in the centre of the screen. One letter in each trial will be WHITE instead of black. Your task is to IGNORE IT. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;The only thing you have to pay attention is to decide whether the letter X appeared anywhere in the trial. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;After each trial, a question will appear on the screen : Did you see the letter X? &amp;#10;Press y for yes and n for no. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Press SPACE to read further" valType="str" updates="constant" name="text"/>
